msgid "### 8.4 Enabled Optimizations"
msgstr "### 8.4 已启用的优化"

msgid "| Feature | Description |"
msgstr "| Feature | Description |"

msgid ""
"| Chunked Prefill | Splits long prefill inputs into chunks to reduce per-"
"step memory peaks. |"
msgstr "| 分块预填充 | 将较长的预填充输入拆分为多个块，以降低每步的内存峰值。 |"

msgid "| W8A8 | Uses Ascend quantization for the validated checkpoint. |"
msgstr "| W8A8 | 对已验证的检查点使用昇腾量化。 |"

msgid "| Lazy Safetensors | Avoids prefetching the complete NFS checkpoint. |"
msgstr "| 惰性安全张量 | 避免预取完整的NFS检查点。 |"

msgid "| MTP | Uses three speculative tokens with the `qwen3_5_mtp` method. |"
msgstr "| MTP | 使用 `qwen3_5_mtp` 方法生成三个推测性令牌。 |"

msgid "| ACL Graph | Uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` replay. |"
msgstr "| ACL图 | 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 重放。 |"

msgid "| CPU Binding | Reduces cross-core scheduling overhead. |"
msgstr "| CPU绑定 | 减少跨核调度开销。 |"

